Spec: Durable server authorization and lease boundary

Purpose:
  Keep server-approved device roles, published scopes and access grants distinct from caller declarations.

Structure:
  ./types.go: Bounded exact-scope models and fixed errors.
  ./lease.go: Standard signed JWT issuance and validated monotonic reception.
  ./store.go: Atomic authority and owner operation persistence.
  ./transport_gate.go: Device/application-bound backend admission and cancellation.
  ./identity.go: Standard mTLS certificate profiles and actual handshake device identity.
  ./witness.go: Independently held transactional rollback witness outside authority backups.
  ./control_stats.go: Saturating aggregate process-local authority counters.
  ./control_server.go: Bounded mTLS Agent control and owner-only administration.

Must:
  Bind access to exact visitor device/application and publisher device/application/service with monotonic generations.
  Preserve original owner operation outcomes and reserve space for every active authority revocation.
  Never treat a claimed application, proxy name or RunID as proof of authenticated device identity.
